<!--
    Play, for the home-screen widget.

    Drawn white and tinted at draw time: a Glance widget renders in the launcher's process out of
    RemoteViews, so it cannot reach the app's Compose icons, and a drawable with a colour baked in
    would be the one thing on the widget that ignores the user's light/dark choice.
-->
